I stand by the window in the living room.
I look out at the city.
The sky is not black anymore.
It slowly becomes gray.
The sun rises late.
I take my phone.
I read the weather forecast for today.
Right now it is very cold.
It is only two degrees.
But it is still dry outside.
Later it becomes very wet.
It will rain soon.
It also becomes windy.
It blows hard later in the day.
It becomes a real winter day.
I put the phone on the table.
I look at the sky one more time.
